# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# a room setting (Fade, Morph, Scene time on Setup 1) turned after a Preset is tapped leaves the sound the Preset's:
# no "changed" (scenes don't keep them); a sound's knob does change it (the 0.3 performer review)
notips
set 71 0
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tapkey w0
wait 1500
expect scene_at 0
page 10
spin K1 3
wait 300
expect scene_at 0
spin K2 2
wait 300
expect scene_at 0
page 0
spin K2 2
wait 300
expect scene_at -1
